@ Diagnostics: name and skip a model shape the renderer cannot draw
@ (code/draw_guard.cpp, ledger F0234). 0x00434AE8 is the per-shape draw
@ (sub_60434AE8, called per shape by 0x60435320); its entry is
@ `push {r4-r11, lr}`, position-independent, so the trampoline can replay it.

DrawGuard_drawShape:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x00434AE8
    symbol:     DrawGuard_drawShape
    trampoline: DrawGuard_drawShape_orig
